172
00:08:07,650 --> 00:08:08,390
Do you have any suggestions?

173
00:08:11,020 --> 00:08:12,140
Do you have any suggestions?

174
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:15,660
So, that's how you would ask for a suggestion.

175
00:08:15,900 --> 00:08:18,760
Or you can say something else like, do you have any ideas?

176
00:08:19,180 --> 00:08:21,580
Yeah, or you might say, do you have any thoughts?

177
00:08:22,060 --> 00:08:26,740
Okay, so that's asking for suggestions.

178
00:08:26,740 --> 00:08:29,620
In response to this, you can say something like this.

179
00:08:31,180 --> 00:08:32,320
I'd recommend giving it a try.

180
00:08:34,300 --> 00:08:36,040
I'd recommend giving it a try.

181
00:08:37,660 --> 00:08:40,390
We also heard another phrase that we use for giving suggestions.

182
00:08:42,300 --> 00:08:45,660
You've got to give them a try.

183
00:08:45,660 --> 00:08:46,870
You've got to give them a try.

184
00:08:48,270 --> 00:08:49,850
So, these two phrases are great.

185
00:08:50,380 --> 00:08:53,620
